<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Assertion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Resources can be thought of as identifiable records or instances of classes and may include, but need not be limited to instances of dwc:Occurrence, dwc:Organism, dwc:MaterialEntity, dwc:Event, dcterms:Location, dwc:GeologicalContext, dwc:Identification, or dwc:Taxon."@en .
