<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Assertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A statement about an rdfs:Resource (http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource)."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Assertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Assertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assertion"@en .
