<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialCitation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This class constitutes a new value for the controlled vocabulary in the recommendations for basisOfRecord. When importing Darwin Core Archives of literature-based datasets to GBIF, the basisOfRecord should be changed from \"Occurrence\", \"PreservedSpecimen\" or \"Literature\" to \"MaterialCitation\"."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialCitation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/MaterialCitation-2021-07-15> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialCitation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/MaterialCitation-2023-09-18> .
