<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/MaterialSample-2014-10-23> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/MaterialSample-2017-10-06> .
