<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/abcdEquivalence> "DataSets/DataSet/Units/Unit" .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/usageScope> "simple" .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A material entity that represents an entity of interest in whole or in part."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Material Sample"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity that represents an entity of interest in whole or in part."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "`a whole organism preserved in a collection`; `a part of an organism isolated for some purpose`; `a soil sample`; `a marine microbial sample`"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/MaterialSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Material Sample"@en .
