<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/assertionUnit> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/organizedInClass> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Assertion> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/assertionUnit> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/usageScope> "extension" .
