<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Biodiversity Information Standards (TDWG)" .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format> "application/rdf+xml" .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2023-07-01T17:28:24-05:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment.rdf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/document> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2020-10-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Recommended best practice is to use controlled value strings from the controlled vocabulary designated for use with this term, listed at http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/doc/doe/. For details, refer to https://doi.org/10.3897/biss.3.38084. This term has an equivalent in the dwciri: namespace that allows only an IRI as a value, whereas this term allows for any string literal value."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/degreeOfEstablishment-2020-10-13> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/degreeOfEstablishment-2021-03-29> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/degreeOfEstablishment-2023-06-28> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/degreeOfEstablishment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
