<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The full, unabbreviated name of the next smaller administrative region than county (city, municipality, etc.) in which the dcterms:Location occurs. Do not use this term for a nearby named place that does not contain the actual dcterms:Location."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
