<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The full, unabbreviated name of the next smaller administrative region than county (city, municipality, etc.) in which the dcterms:Location occurs. Do not use this term for a nearby named place that does not contain the actual dcterms:Location."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/municipality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "`Holzminden`; `Araçatuba`; `Ga-Segonyana`"@en .
