<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/organismScope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Recommended best practice is to use a controlled vocabulary. This term is not intended to be used to specify a type of dwc:Taxon. To describe the kind of dwc:Organism using a URI object in RDF, use rdf:type (http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type) instead."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/organismScope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/organismScope-2014-10-23> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/organismScope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/organismScope-2017-10-06> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/organismScope> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/organismScope-2023-06-28> .
