<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/pointRadiusSpatialFit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A ratio of the area of a point-radius (dwc:decimalLatitude, dwc:decimalLongitude, dwc:coordinateUncertaintyInMeters) to the area of a true (original, or most specific) spatial representation of a dcterms:Location."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/pointRadiusSpatialFit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
