<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/scientificName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The full scientific name, with authorship and date information if known. When forming part of a dwc:Identification, this should be the name in lowest level taxonomic rank that can be determined."@en .
