<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/scientificName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "`Coleoptera` (order); `Vespertilionidae` (family); `Manis` (genus); `Ctenomys sociabilis` (genus + specificEpithet); `Ambystoma tigrinum diaboli` (genus + specificEpithet + infraspecificEpithet); `Roptrocerus typographi (Györfi, 1952)` (genus + specificEpithet + scientificNameAuthorship); `Quercus agrifolia var. oxyadenia (Torr.) J.T. Howell` (genus + specificEpithet + taxonRank + infraspecificEpithet + scientificNameAuthorship); `×Agropogon littoralis (Sm.) C. E. Hubb.`; `Mentha ×smithiana R. A. Graham`; `Agrostis stolonifera L. × Polypogon monspeliensis (L.) Desf.`"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/scientificName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Scientific Name"@en .
