<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/taxonomicStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The status of the use of the dwc:scientificName as a label for a taxon. Requires taxonomic opinion to define the scope of a dwc:Taxon. Rules of priority then are used to define the taxonomic status of the nomenclature contained in that scope, combined with the experts opinion. It must be linked to a specific taxonomic reference that defines the concept."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/taxonomicStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "`invalid`; `misapplied`; `homotypic synonym`; `accepted`"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/taxonomicStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taxonomic Status"@en .
