<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/verbatimIdentification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This term is meant to allow the capture of an unaltered original identification/determination, including identification qualifiers, hybrid formulas, uncertainties, etc. This term is meant to be used in addition to dwc:scientificName (and dwc:identificationQualifier etc.), not instead of it."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/verbatimIdentification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/version/verbatimIdentification-2021-07-15> .
