<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/verbatimLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A verbatim original representation of the written information affixed or related to a dwc:MaterialEntity."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/verbatimLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/> .
